@GatewayService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5046
@token = your_token_here

### AUTH SERVICE THROUGH GATEWAY

### Login
POST {{GatewayService_HostAddress}}/gateway/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sagarrajput1810@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### JOB SERVICE THROUGH GATEWAY

### Get All Jobs
GET {{GatewayService_HostAddress}}/gateway/job
Accept: application/json

### SEARCH SERVICE THROUGH GATEWAY

### Search Jobs
GET {{GatewayService_HostAddress}}/gateway/search?query=software
Accept: application/json

### PROFILE SERVICE THROUGH GATEWAY

### Get Candidate Profile By User ID
GET {{GatewayService_HostAddress}}/gateway/candidate/user/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### APPLICATION SERVICE THROUGH GATEWAY

### Get My Applications
GET {{GatewayService_HostAddress}}/gateway/application/my-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### NOTIFICATION SERVICE THROUGH GATEWAY

### Get Unread Count
GET {{GatewayService_HostAddress}}/gateway/notification/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### FILE UPLOADS THROUGH GATEWAY

### Get Uploaded File
GET {{GatewayService_HostAddress}}/gateway/uploads/resumes/resume.pdf
